scripts/dev/gen_notices.py from third_party/notices.json and the Rust crates the app links.

Bundled models:

- SenseVoiceSmall, by the FunAudioLLM team, Tongyi Lab, Alibaba Group
  (https://github.com/FunAudioLLM/SenseVoice), under the FunASR Model Open Source License 1.1
  (third_party/licenses/funasr-model-license.txt). Converted to ONNX and quantized to int8 by
  the k2-fsa sherpa-onnx project. The model name is kept unchanged.
- Silero VAD 4.0, by the Silero Team (https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad), MIT.

Downloaded on request, not bundled:

- Qwen3-ASR 0.6B, by the Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud (https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-ASR),
  Apache-2.0.

Linked native libraries include sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0), ONNX Runtime (MIT, with its own
third-party notices), kaldi-native-fbank, kaldi-decoder, kaldifst, OpenFst (Apache-2.0), KISS FFT
(BSD-3-Clause), simple-sentencepiece (Apache-2.0), utf8proc (MIT), JSON for Modern C++ (MIT),
Eigen (MPL-2.0, source at https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen), libopus (BSD-3-Clause, source in
